# The Jack-o'-Lantern: the Elder Bough's ball, and the game's icon.
# A rounded pumpkin cube with a glowing face on the front.
size 7 8 7
voxel 0.05
colors
  p pumpkin
  P pumpkinDark
  s stemGreen
  g glow
box 1 0 1 5 6 5 p
box 0 1 1 6 5 5 p
box 1 1 0 5 5 6 p
# Ridges on the sides and back.
box 0 1 3 0 5 3 P
box 6 1 3 6 5 3 P
box 3 1 6 3 5 6 P
# Stem.
box 3 7 3 3 7 3 s
# Face.
box 2 4 0 2 4 0 g
box 4 4 0 4 4 0 g
box 2 2 0 4 2 0 g
